    <string name="overclock_about">Faster emulation for demanding games, at a cost: the console gets warmer, the battery drains faster, and some consoles freeze or crash at the higher speeds. If that happens, pick a lower speed.\n\nThe console always starts at standard speed, a restart turns the overclock off. It also slows down by itself when it gets too hot.</string>

    <string name="overclock_unsupported">This console can\'t be overclocked.</string>
    <string name="overclock_failed">Couldn\'t change the CPU speed</string>

